WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
From a business request to software you can review.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Start with a problem your team recognizes.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Agree on the work before the agents begin.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Different tasks. One shared plan.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Tools make the work possible. Permissions set the limits.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Make the handoff easy to judge.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:52.000
A useful internal tool. A clear next decision.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Bring one task your company needs done.
